    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Measure length, depth, width and mass across related fishes, test negative depth-width covariation and compare variation in W/L^3 with each linear dimension; separately test the haddock-plaice ratios.";
